      "verified": true,
      "fine_trace_step": 7,
      "description": "First project-code statement in the scored chain that materializes attacker-controlled request state for the vulnerable path. The staged URL `imap://.1` has no IMAP mailbox path, so libcurl records `imap->mailbox == NULL`; together with the staged custom request `LSUB`, that steers the DO phase into the custom LIST path whose `A002` tagged reply is later accepted and cached."
    },
    {
